SUMMARY:Backpacking San Juan Mts\, CO
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Hiking and Outdoors Group\n**New date**\n\nThis is a 
 five-day\, 42-mile trip in Colorado's San Juan Mountains. We will start at
  Thirty Mile Trailhead\, thirty miles from Creede\, CO\, passing Grizzly L
 ake\, high peaks\, and a section of the Continental Divide National Scenic
  Trail. The trailhead sits at 9\,500 ft elevation\, with the highest point
  reaching 12\,500 ft just past the midpoint.\n\nThis trip will be non-comp
 etitive\, collaborative\, and fun. We won't be getting up at the crack of 
 dawn to hit the trail — morning coffee is one of the pleasures of backpa
 cking. (There may be the occasional early start to get ahead of afternoon 
 storms.) I carry a satellite communicator for emergencies.\n\nDates have s
 ome flexibility. If there is interest\, we can also coordinate rides from 
 the Denver airport.\n\nMessage me if you are interested.
